19. It is to be noted that the evidence/testimony of the injured witnesses has greater evidentiary value and unless compelling reasons exist, their statements are not to be discarded lightly as observed by the Hon'ble Apex Court in the case(s) of State of M.P. vs. Mansingh (2003) 10 SCC 414;
Abdul Sayeed vs. State of M.P. (2010) 10 SCC 259; State of U.P. vs. Naresh; (2011) 4 SCC 324 and Ramchander And 3 Ors. vs State Of U.P. on 4 July, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/142340608/
